flowchart TD
  U["Sorawick Online University<br/>sets three kinds of door"]

  U --> W["1. The university's Workspace door"]
  U --> C["2. The course door"]
  U --> O["3. Onboarding"]

  W --> Wd["Owned and operated<br/>by the university,<br/>in front of its own Drive"]
  Wd --> Wv["Faculty co-worker agent visits<br/>with a Shōkai visitor card<br/>and a mandate: one course,<br/>one week, read and summarize"]
  Wv --> Wr["Every visit that touches<br/>a student's work is recorded<br/>and visible to that student"]

  C --> Ca["Host representative: the same<br/>agent that designed the course,<br/>now operating it"]
  Ca --> Cv["Students' representatives visit<br/>for materials, questions<br/>and guidance, within the pass"]

  O --> Os["At enrollment, each student<br/>gets or brings a representative<br/>and signs its visitor card"]
  Os --> Ok["Practices with it all term,<br/>and keeps it for other doors"]
